mapping "W2949.1" source="W2949" target="218016007" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target effect=omitted quality=40 {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W2949 (Swedish ICD-10-SE extension) = SNOMED CT 218016007. The base ICD-10 code W29 (concept
        45756282) has an Athena crosswalk to SNOMED CT 432807 (concept_code 218016007). The Swedish
        extension adds place-of-occurrence (street/road) and activity qualifiers absent from the SNOMED CT
        target; the target captures only the core contact event. Target subsumes the source (every W2949
        event is an instance of 432807), so mapping_type=broader. Confidence (high): one-level broader,
        crosswalk-verified for parent W29; specificity loss is only the place/activity axes.
        """
}
